{"id":"551febe7ebb4dbc6","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-fin.md","title":"有限 c.e. 集合的索引集","display":"df-fin — 有限 c.e. 集合的索引集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-fin","aliases":["20-df-fin"],"display":"df-fin — 有限 c.e. 集合的索引集","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.15","source_pdf_pages":[53],"source_printed_pages":[17],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-fin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-fin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fin — 有限 c.e. 集合的索引集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fin}=\\{e:|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fin}=\\{e:|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span> 是索引集合，见 fin。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fin}:=\\{e:|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fin}:=\\{e:|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Fin 是自然数索引的集合，不是所有有限子集构成的集合族。用于 Cof 定义时应直接写补集有限，不能写补集属于 Fin。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.15；印刷页 17；PDF 第 53 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fin}=\\{e:|W_e|<\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fin}:=\\{e:|W_e|<\\omega\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":918,"backlinks":[{"id":"574494b7c7eef96a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-fin]]。"},{"id":"5b297c57a51d3204","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-fin]]；see [[20-thm-inf-complexity]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]。"},{"id":"b38c6122dd933fec","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-fin-complexity]]；see [[20-thm-inf-complexity]]；see [[20-thm-tot-complexity]]；see [[20-thm-cof-complexity]]；see [[20-thm-rec-complexity]]；see [[20-df-cof]]；see [[20-df-fin]]；see [[20-df-inf]]；see [[20-df-totex]]；see [[20-df-rec-index]]；se